                    <xs:documentation>A number or code associated with an item lot.  In some cases,
                        the lot number will be populated with a date (common in grocery and deli).
                        A lot number may be assigned by a manufaturer or
                        retailer.</xs:documentation>
                </xs:annotation>
            </xs:element>
